 "description": "Concept study: the Plan Factory SF 1258 'F' plan grown to 1,600 sf of living area for Dantega Homes / Daniel Orhiunu. The original diagram is kept intact (primary suite rear-left with bath, W.I.C. and utility in front of it; open kitchen-dining-living in the center with the walk-in pantry against the suite wall; two bedrooms and Bath 2 in the right wing with Bedroom-2 projecting toward the street; front-gabled two-car garage with the recessed covered porch beside it). The main body grows from 44'-10\" x 26'-4\" to 50'-8\" x 30'-0\" with every wall snapped to 2\" framing increments, so each room grows roughly in proportion: the great room band deepens to 14'-6\", the primary bedroom becomes 15'-6\" x 13'-6\", secondary bedrooms 12'-8\" wide, the pantry a true 5'-8\" walk-in and the utility a 6'-8\" x 9'-10\" laundry/mud room. Not for construction.",
